DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The cclloocckk() function returns an approximation of processor time used by
       the program.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       The value returned is the CPU time used so far as a _c_l_o_c_k___t; to get the
       number  of  seconds  used,  divide by CCLLOOCCKKSS__PPEERR__SSEECC.  If the processor
       time used is not available or its  value  cannot  be  represented,  the
       function returns the value _(_c_l_o_c_k___t_) _-_1.

